      "t": "rich",
      "html": "<p><strong>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary is an adult-use cannabis dispensary located on Route 6 in South Wellfleet, proudly serving residents and visitors throughout Cape Cod, including:</strong></p><p><a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-barnstable/\">Barnstable</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-bourne-02532/\">Bourne</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-brewster/\">Brewster</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-chatham-02633/\">Chatham</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-dennis/\">Dennis</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-eastham-02642/\">Eastham</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-falmouth/\">Falmouth</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-harwich/\">Harwich</a> • <a href=\"/dispensary-near-me-in-hyannis-02601/\">Hyannis</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-mashpee/\">Mashpee</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-orleans/\">Orleans</a> • <a href=\"/dispensary-near-provincetown/\">Provincetown</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-sandwich/\">Sandwich</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-truro/\">Truro</a> • <a href=\"/dispensary-near-me-in-wellfleet-02667/\">Wellfleet</a> • <a href=\"/recreational-dispensary-near-me-in-yarmouth/\">Yarmouth</a></p>"
     }
    ]
